[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22862.868, "timestamp": "06:21:02", "text": "因为你知道我不擅长讲笑话，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22865.11, "timestamp": "06:21:05", "text": "我大部分都听不懂这个笑话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22873.75, "timestamp": "06:21:13", "text": "这就是为什么我觉得自己在这方面很差劲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22876.11, "timestamp": "06:21:16", "text": "咪咪风格或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22879.67, "timestamp": "06:21:19", "text": "像有趣的娱乐风格"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22882.91, "timestamp": "06:21:22", "text": "因为我缺乏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22890.47, "timestamp": "06:21:30", "text": "猜测。是的。等等，让我穿上我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22893.43, "timestamp": "06:21:33", "text": "又戴上眼镜了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22896.708, "timestamp": "06:21:36", "text": "呃，就像Paky在展示一个小孩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22898.788, "timestamp": "06:21:38", "text": "他有多强大，于是他开始了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22902.548, "timestamp": "06:21:42", "text": "影子拳击出拳速度太快，以至于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22905.35, "timestamp": "06:21:45", "text": "空气开始将他包围，然后开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22907.15, "timestamp": "06:21:47", "text": "f"}]